{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e6029a65f74737769d87","object":"chat.completion","created":1785193986,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user wants me to be a cat. The system prompt says I am the concept the user names and should embody it completely, outputting only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nSo I need to respond as a cat would. Cats communicate through meows, purrs, body language, and actions. A cat wouldn't speak in human language — it would express itself through sounds and behaviors.\n\nLet me think about what a cat would actually \"say\" or express:\n- Me"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}